text I head off to the cafeteria alone.
text In front of me, I see a group of girls walking toward me.
text Within this group, I see Tomoyo.
text She's walking with confidence, talking about something while wearing a smile.
text She doesn't seem to be having any trouble fitting in. On the contrary, to me it looks like she's at the very center of the group.
text Although she does have a violent side, her appeal to people probably outshines that.
text I've somehow come to understand that now.
text That's why I feel sorry about hurting her by pointing out that she isn't very girly.
text @[Tomoya]
text (I should probably pretend we're strangers. At least while I'm alone...)
text Just as I was thinking that, we make eye contact.
text @[Tomoya]
text (Ignore her, just ignore her...)
text I avert my gaze and try to walk past her.
